    "comment": "2024 'Summon X' spirit stat blocks for compute_summon_loadout. One record per FORM.",
    "comment2": "AC = ac_base + slot_level. HP = hp_base + hp_per_level*(slot_level - base_level), where",
    "comment3": "hp_base is HP AT the spell's base_level. Attack damage = num_dice d die_size + dmg_flat +",
    "comment4": "dmg_per_level*slot_level; dmg_flat is the card's printed flat (= the spirit's ability mod),",
    "comment5": "and the engine's re-added ability mod is cancelled so the printed total is exact. num_attacks",
    "comment6": "= slot//2 when multiattack_half_level (the universal 2024 'Rend = half spell level' rule).",
    "comment7": "'verified': true = transcribed from the PHB card; false = best-effort, still needs checking.",
    "spell": "_README", "form": "_README", "name": "_README"
  },

